Arachnotes(TM) and the Arachnotes spider logo are trademarks of CAK3D_Creations.

Arachnotes is a reading and study app: a spider crawls any text, finds its
keywords and topics, and turns them into study guides, flashcards and cited
notes.

This software, including its source code, artwork, spider designs, themes,
and documentation (the "Software"), is proprietary and confidential.

